  "description": "The D300 is a high-performance foldable e-bike engineered to balance power, safety, and utility. Designed for both daily commutes and weekend leisure, its space-saving frame folds effortlessly to fit into car trunks, elevators, or small apartments, offering ultimate portability without compromising on performance.\n\nDriven by a robust 1200W peak motor, the D300 delivers a thrilling top speed of 28Mph, making steep hills and long distances feel effortless. Paired with a high-capacity 48V 20.8Ah battery, it provides an impressive 80-mile range, ensuring you can handle a full week of commuting or a long day of exploring on a single charge.\n\nSafety is at the core of the D300. It features high-precision 160mm dual disc brakes for reliable, short-distance stopping power in any weather. The integrated LED lighting system, including a bright headlight and a flashing rear brake light, ensures maximum visibility, while the NFC-enabled LCD display offers secure, instant activation and real-time tracking of your vitals.\n\nNavigate any terrain with ease thanks to the *20\"4.0\" puncture-resistant fat tires and a responsive front suspension fork with 80mm of travel. These features work together to absorb bumps and vibrations, while the ergonomic, cushioned saddle (adjustable from 32.3\" to 38.6\") ensures a natural, fatigue-free posture for riders of all sizes.\n\nBuilt for maximum hauling, the D300 boasts a massive 360 lbs total weight capacity. Equipped with a dual-rack system (front and rear), with the reinforced rear rack alone handling 120 lbs, it is the perfect companion for carrying heavy groceries, delivery parcels, or camping gear with absolute stability and ease.",
